  operator.to_dense()
  ==> [[4 + 0.0j, 1 - 0.6j, 1 + 0.6j],
       [1 + 0.6j, 4 + 0.0j, 1 - 0.6j],
       [1 - 0.6j, 1 + 0.6j, 4 + 0.0j]]
  ```

