  if, with `%` meaning modulus division,

  ```H[..., n % N] = ComplexConjugate[ H[..., (-n) % N] ]```

  * This operator corresponds to a real matrix if and only if `H` is Hermitian.
  * This operator is self-adjoint if and only if `H` is real.

